  "content": "<style>\n  .translate-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; }\n  .translate-table td, .translate-table th { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }\n  .translate-table tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f9f9f9; }\n  .translate-table th { background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; }\n  .translate-table img { max-width: 100px; }\n</style>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">![农夫之刃](https://i.postimg.cc/T1cDttyv/farmers-knives-banner.png)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">为农夫乐事添加多种模组材料的刀具！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>支持列表：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Adabranium](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adabranium)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">维布拉纽姆（Vibranium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">亚德曼蒂姆（Adamantium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界砖</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Additional Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">玫瑰金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">镀金下界合金</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Advanced Netherite](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金-铁</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金-金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金-绿宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金-钻石</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Aphid Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aphid-additions)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">几丁质</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[BetterEnd](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">萨拉希姆（Thallasium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">特米尼特（Terminite）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">埃特尼姆（Aeternium）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[BetterNether](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">辛西纳赛特（Cincinnasite）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">辛西纳赛特-钻石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界红宝石</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Botania](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">魔力钢（Manasteel）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">源质钢（Elementium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">大地钢（Terrasteel）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Conjuring](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conjuring)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">灵魂合金</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Copper Age Backport](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Create Stuff and Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">黄铜<br>锌</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Deeper and Darker](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">守御者（Warden）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Dragon Loot](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">龙</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Easy Emerald Tools & More](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">绿宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">红宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">紫水晶</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">黑曜石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-reborn-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">残骸（Remnant）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">羽神铁（Featherzeal）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Enderite Mod](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">末影下界合金（Enderite）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Gobber](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">哥布林合金（Gobber）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界哥布林合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">末地哥布林合金</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Mythic Metals](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">亚德曼蒂特（Adamantite）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">水族合金（Aquarium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">邦格卢姆（Banglum）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">青铜</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">卡莫特（Carmot）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">塞莱斯蒂姆（Celestium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">杜拉钢（Durasteel）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">神圣合金（Hallowed）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">凯伯尔（Kyber）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">传奇邦格卢姆</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">冶金钢（Metallurgium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">秘银（Mythril）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">奥里哈康（Orichalcum）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">锇（Osmium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钯（Palladium）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">普罗米修姆（Prometheum）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">夸德里卢姆（Quadrillum）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">符文钢（Runite）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">星际白金（Star Platinum）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">斯托米克斯（Stormyx）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">潮汐歌者（Tidesinger）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Oh The Biomes You'll Go](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">潘多瑞特（Pendorite）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progression-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progression Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">玫瑰（Rose）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[The Twilight Forest](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铁木（Ironwood）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">炽热（Fiery）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢叶（Steeleaf）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">骑士金属（Knightmetal）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Vanilla Backport](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Winterly](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">冰晶大理石（Cryomarble）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>2.1版本中所有刀具：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">![刀具](https://i.ibb.co/8zPxdqC/image-2022-08-17-164723137.png)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">（不包括暮色森林、Adabranium、Advanced Netherite、Winterly、Mythic Metals 的潮汐歌者、Progression Reborn、End Reborn 和 Create Stuff & Additions）</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">**鸣谢：**</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">感谢 The Skeleton Appears 为 Mythic Metals 刀具提供的纹理</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如有更多建议，请<a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/farmersknives/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a>提交！</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">点击下方任意链接查看我的其他作品：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[![加入Discord服务器](https://i.ibb.co/KrWjv8p/discord-rectangle-500x160.png)](https://discord.gg/qyYwHykSmE)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[![我的GitHub](https://i.ibb.co/vmx15sd/download.png)](https://github.com/ianm1647/)</p>",
